# Build artifacts - IMPORTANT NOTE
# The setup script (npm run setup) manages these artifacts based on the
# deployment strategy you pick during the wizard:
#   CLI push / "Not sure yet": wraps assets/ and snippets/vite.liquid in a
#     managed block below (delimited by # >>> VAST setup ... <<< markers).
#   GitHub integration: removes the managed block (and any legacy bare lines)
#     so Shopify's GitHub sync can track assets/ and snippets/vite.liquid.
# Reruns are idempotent — the wizard rewrites or removes its managed block
# based on the current answer, so it's safe to switch strategies later.
# Contributors working on VAST can use .git/info/exclude for local-only
# ignore rules that won't be committed.